# The Virtual Keyboard (cavekit-flash.md R7): a key tapped sounds, by the samples at the output sink, and the
# instrument is silent again when the note has died; a second key sounds again.
id: flash-app-piano
section: Flash
item: A Flash app does its task, the piano: a tapped key sounds at the output sink, silence follows the note, another key sounds again
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8097/title/virtual-piano
kit: cavekit-flash.md R7
wait rect m 40
wait still m 25
stage-tap m 725 317 362 120
wait still m 8
expect sound silent 12
stage-tap m 725 317 177 270
expect sound heard 4
shoot key
expect sound silent 16
stage-tap m 725 317 322 270
expect sound heard 4
